Grammar:

Rule 0     S' -> PROGRAM
Rule 1     PROGRAM -> DEVICES CMDS
Rule 2     DEVICES -> DEVICE
Rule 3     DEVICES -> DEVICE DEVICES
Rule 4     DEVICE -> dispositivo : { ID , ID }
Rule 5     DEVICE -> dispositivo : { ID }
Rule 6     CMDS -> CMD .
Rule 7     CMDS -> CMD . CMDS
Rule 8     CMD -> ACT
Rule 9     CMD -> OBSACT
Rule 10    CMD -> ATTRIB
Rule 11    ATTRIB -> set ID = ACTEXECUTE
Rule 12    ATTRIB -> set ID = VAR
Rule 13    OBSACT -> se OBS entao CMDS senao CMDS
Rule 14    OBSACT -> se OBS entao CMDS
Rule 15    OBS -> ID OPLOGIC VAR CONJUNCTION OBS
Rule 16    OBS -> ID OPLOGIC VAR
Rule 17    VAR -> BOOL
Rule 18    VAR -> NUM
Rule 19    ACT -> ACTALERT
Rule 20    ACT -> ACTEXECUTE
Rule 21    ACTEXECUTE -> ACTION ID
Rule 22    ACTALERT -> enviar alerta ( ID , ID ) ID
Rule 23    ACTALERT -> enviar alerta ( ID ) ID

Terminals, with rules where they appear:

(                    : 22 23
)                    : 22 23
,                    : 4 22
.                    : 6 7
:                    : 4 5
=                    : 11 12
ACTION               : 21
BOOL                 : 17
CONJUNCTION          : 15
